  "notes": [
   "The manual is only pictures at low resolution, so the exact placement of several pieces is a best guess. The piece inventory matches the parts list exactly (38 pieces).",
   "The step 3 plates and arches are guessed: the red 2x4 plates b5 and b6 sit on the gray base b3, and the arches b7 and b8 sit on them.",
   "Step 5 front sub-assembly: red bracket b10 carries two clip plates (b11, b12) with trans-clear round plates as headlights (b14, b15), and a grille tile (b13) on the front flange. The bracket is attached to the chassis front.",
   "The positions of the side-handle plates b16 and b17, the black 1x2 plates b18 and b19, the trans-red plates b25 and b26 (assumed to be tail or dash lights), the red 1x1 bricks b21 and b22 and the trans-brown window bricks b23 and b24 are approximate.",
   "Ports are left null where the exact stud positions could not be read from the pictures.",
   "The roof is assumed to be the red 4x4 plate b27 with three red 1x2 plates on top (b28 to b30). Tyres are joined to wheels, and the wheels are joined to the 4600 wheel holders through axle-holes."
  ]
 },
